  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healing with Art and Music: Nablus&apos; Refugee Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our arts and music program will offer theater, music, and dance classes for Palestinian refugee children in Nablus provides a safe and supportive environment for them to channel their negative energy and emotions into something positive while discovering and developing their artistic skills. With limited access to education and resources, these children face unique challenges, but through our program, they can express themselves and build their self-confidence.</narrative>
  </description>
